The energy blast came from the Ice Flame in the Snow Lady's heart awakening the Ice Flame in the heart of the legendary Snowstorm Dragon, which came back to life.

Here is the Sphere of Fire, which I made with the power of the goddess Idhas channeled through King Zarad's Legendary Trident. We must stop the glacial river at its sources: on land and at sea.

Please, take the Sphere of Fire to Snowstorm Valley.

[Challenge Objective]

Defeat 150 monsters in Gallubia Valley and summon the Sphere of Fire in Snowstorm Valley, in the marked area.
When you are done, talk to Ruby, the Fire Priestess, in Pillai.
